# ==== Postman ====
# postman/OAS_Auth_Service.* is tracked and targets the deployed environment.
# The local-test pair points at localhost and stays local-only.
postman/OAS_Auth_Service_local_test.*

# ==== Documents ====
# README.md is the single tracked document; drafts and notes stay local.
*.md
!README.md
